sequenceDiagram
    title Numeric Comparison Pairing Example

    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    note over App, Node: Precondition: connected.<br>IoCapabilities set to displayYesNo.

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: Initiate pairing
        App->>Node: PairAndBond()
        Node-->>App: AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)

        note over App: Display "485923" to the user.<br>User verifies the same number appears on the peripheral.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: User confirms match
        App->>Node: NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        Node-->>App: NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        Node-->>App: PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)

        note over App: Bond stored. Keys (LTK, IRK) exchanged.<br>Future reconnections use encryption without re-pairing.
    end
